@startuml
!include style.iuml
title State Machine Diagram – Order Status
hide empty description

[*] --> Pending : customer places order\n/ createOrder(), timestamp = now

state Pending : entry / show "Order received"
state Preparing : entry / show "Being prepared"
state Ready : entry / show "Ready" (pickup or table)
state Served : entry / stop timer
state Cancelled : entry / stop timer

Pending --> Preparing : after 10 s\nor manager "Start preparing"
Preparing --> Ready : after 20 s\nor manager "Mark ready"
Ready --> Served : after 30 s\nor manager "Mark served"

Pending --> Cancelled : customer or manager cancels
Preparing --> Cancelled : customer or manager cancels

Served --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note right of Ready
  Status only moves FORWARD.
  The reducer ignores backward
  or repeated updates.
end note
@enduml
